      "text": "§483.90(e)(1)(vii) Have a floor at or above grade level.",
      "id": "appendix-pp-f916-p2"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 895,
      "section_label": "Guidance",
      "text": "GUIDANCE: §483.90(e)(1)(vii)",
      "id": "appendix-pp-f916-p3"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 896,
      "section_label": "Guidance",
      "text": "“At or above grade level” means a room in which the room floor is at or above the surrounding exterior ground level. No resident rooms in basements or below ground level are allowed.",
      "id": "appendix-pp-f916-p4"
    },
    {
